      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8e/bl7s9encr91wlzkq5bvxay086j08drn.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其二",
      "desc": "烹饪该算体力活还是脑力活呢，或许都算吧，难怪你能做得这么好！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_heizou/vo_heizou_spice_normal_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8c/59v9qtx1fx0ps7aie7a47xo9dvqtrfc.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其三",
      "desc": "让我想想…你是在哪个步骤出错了…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_heizou/vo_heizou_spice_dislike_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5f/gvd9ijrzbu9mxfv9tib9yizaidn60mw.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "生日…",
      "desc": "在知道今天是你的生日之后，有那么一瞬间，我想把你带到一间摆满了机关与礼物的密室里，让你解出谜题后再出来…嘿嘿，开玩笑的啦，在确认你是否喜欢之前，我是不会这么做的。来，和我一起走吧，趁着太阳还没落山，有非常漂亮的景色想和你分享哦！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_heizou/vo_heizou_pref_birthday_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/df/todcst999ijldhafkzd5qoc6bf9gj46.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·起",
      "desc": "我的直觉告诉我…你想让我变强！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_heizou/vo_heizou_starUp_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f0/a5s3cop2gjqz1qt55amccz3ouwz2uvv.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·承",
      "desc": "武力是增加了，脑力也有这样的增幅就好了…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_heizou/vo_heizou_starUp_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/df/7e0eevlfyhj056usngo37up5yi1129v.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·转",
      "desc": "哎呀呀，我真要变成大家口中的「风暴」了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_heizou/vo_heizou_starUp_03",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/18/nzyvg1fa7p7duradkym6h4g320jt83n.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·合",
      "desc": "谢谢你对我的信任和付出，我的搭档，能做到这一步多亏了你。来击掌吧，接下来也一起去解开更多的谜团！",
